              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "રુઝાવું — rujhāvũ — \"to heal (of a wound)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "આ ઘા એક અઠવાડિયામાં રુઝાઈ જશે. ā ghā ek aṭhvāḍiyāmā̃ rujhāī jaśe. This wound will heal in a week."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): તે ઘા રુઝાઈ ગયો, te ghā rujhāī gayo."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "રુઝાવું (rujhāvũ) is inherited from Sanskrit rudhyatē, \"is stopped, is obstructed\": a wound that closes. CDIAL lists the Gujarati verb, \"to be healed, of a wound\" (CDIAL 10779)."
            }
          ]
        },
